# Search noise for ripgrep (and tools built on it: Claude Code Grep, VS Code/Cursor search).
# Files stay tracked and served; this only keeps them out of searches.
# Search them anyway with `rg -uu …` or by passing the file path directly.

# Generated/baked SVGs: up to 6.8 MB, single lines up to 768 KB
public/assets/
public/match/

package-lock.json

# Study/playtest output data (the .md summaries next to them stay searchable)
docs/research/*.json
docs/research/*.csv
docs/research/playtest-logs/

# One-off locale patches, already merged into src/i18n/locales/*.json
scripts/help-locale-patch.json
scripts/story-help-locale-extra.json
scripts/p2-spend-locale.json
scripts/sponsor-locale.json
